{"id":"4846","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4846_main_cirrus-spissatus-radiatus-cirrus-uncinus-radiatus-cirrus-floccus-and-cirrocumulus-floccus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示的是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷积云</span>发展成为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩卷云</span>，其各部分合并进入<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>。还存在一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>的元素。钩卷云和密卷云属于辐状云类，因强烈的南 - 西南风将卷云排列成平行的带状物，这些带状物似乎会聚在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地平线上的一个点</span>上。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国康沃尔 TR4 9EL特鲁罗Tregavethan","latitude":"纬度: 50° 16' 54'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 6' 59'' W","date":"06 August 2009 1919 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.9","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.9"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4846_syn_cirrus-spissatus-radiatus-cirrus-uncinus-radiatus-cirrus-floccus-and-cirrocumulus-floccus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>英国英格兰西南部位于亚速尔群岛反气旋的脊线下，而英格兰南部则是一个相当活跃的波锋。与锋系统相关的广泛高云持续一整天，一直到英国康沃尔郡的东部和东北部。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4846_upper_cirrus-spissatus-radiatus-cirrus-uncinus-radiatus-cirrus-floccus-and-cirrocumulus-floccus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从1200 UTC开始，英国英格兰坎伯恩附近（拍摄照片的西南15公里）上升流，显示卷云层非常潮湿，高于825 hPa的强反气旋逆温。卷云层的风力非常强，南西南的风力接近100 kt  - 仲夏时非常高。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4846_sat_cirrus-spissatus-radiatus-cirrus-uncinus-radiatus-cirrus-floccus-and-cirrocumulus-floccus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>6个小时前的卫星图像显示英国康沃尔郡上空的锋面云较厚（那天早上有几个点有降雨），那时密卷云云带位于康沃尔郡西部。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© NEODAAS/邓迪大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4799_main_cirrus-fibratus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张照片显示了卷云的细节，其中包括<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛状云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩状云</span>云种，由于角度，平行的云带似乎朝向一个点汇聚，这两种云种都<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">辐状</span>云类。还存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">薄片</span>的高积云和淡积云（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span>）。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tsz Cheung Lee","location":"日本北海道美瑛","latitude":"纬度: 43° 36' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 142° 27' 15'' E","date":"21 July 2006 1330 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= 3, CH= 4","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.9 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.9 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5816_main_cirrus-fibratus-radiatus-and-cumulus-humilis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>辐辏状毛卷云和淡积云</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Victor Oviedo","location":"阿根廷，恩特雷里奥斯省，康科迪亚","latitude":"纬度: 31° 23' 29'' S","longitude":"经度: 58° 1' 3'' W","date":"15 March 2013 1649 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.9 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.9 2"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4502_main_cirrus-uncinus-radiatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>（注：时间仅为估计；下午早些时候）</p>\n<p>此视角下的卷云呈现出多样的形态。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置1处的钩卷云</span>显示其丝状末端呈钩状和簇状。云场的其他部分则呈现出小范围的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">斑块</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">条带</span>，在图片左下方向地平线汇聚。卷云正逐步侵入天空；然而未见卷层云出现；因此编码为C<sub>H</sub> = 4。观测点位于强劲（风速70米/秒）的西风急流下方。低层附近存在一个脊线，东侧伴有凉爽的西北风，西侧则有干燥的南风回流。</p></div>","copyright":"© H.B. Bluestein","location":"Norman, Oklahoma, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 35° 13' 21'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 26' 22'' W","date":"09 October 1977 1400 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 4","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}